<title>FINLAND: ENSTO BUYS REST OF SALOPLAST.</title>
<headline>ENSTO BUYS REST OF SALOPLAST.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish electrical equipment maker Oy Ensto Ab said in a statement on Wednesday it had bought the rest of Saloplast for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>In 1996, Saloplasts net sales were 139 million markka and Ensto's net sales were 1.01 billion markka, Ensto said.</p>
<p>It gave no futher details.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
